  <jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsNotBasedOnResolutionOfShareholdersMeetingOrBoardOfDirectorsMeetingTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3"&gt;(3) 【株主総会決議又は取締役会決議に基づかないものの内容】&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:27.5pt;padding-right:0pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsNotBasedOnResolutionOfShareholdersMeetingOrBoardOfDirectorsMeetingTextBlock>
